/run/initialize
/vis/open OGL
/vis/drawVolume
/vis/viewer/set/viewpointThetaPhi 90 0 deg
/vis/viewer/set/targetPoint 0 0.07 0.5 mm
/vis/viewer/set/style surface
/vis/scene/add/axes 0 0 0 0.1 mm
/tracking/storeTrajectory 1
/vis/scene/add/trajectories
# Pas d'avalanche au demarrage. Dans la console, lancer /run/beamOn 1 si voulu.
